Wands of death are fairly rare, and you just plain got really unlucky. I 
would suggest keeping an eye out a little better for the items. If you 
hit a wand-toting monster before minetown or Sokoban, not much you can 
do. All I'd recommend is just go to greater lengths identifying items.

Some ideas:
Minetown often has a cloak, amulet, or magic lamp.
Sokoban has the 50% chance at the end as others mentioned, but also (I 
believe) generates other amulets to increase your chances.
Many classes have a MR quest artifact, if you hurry to the quest (or wish).
Wizards start with MR.
Sac for Magicbane if neutral.
If you can handle a water demon, consider quaffing upper level fountains 
for wishes.

